  {
   "index": 9,
   "tag": "p×4",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 779,
   "text": "In theory, the critical waterway has been under Iranian control since the outbreak of war with the US on Feb 28, holding the world economy to ransom and choking off global oil supplies.\nIn fact, several Gulf states have embarked on a clandestine operation to shake Tehran’s grip on the strait it claims sovereignty over. They are employing “dark fleets” to evade the regime, turning to tactics Iran o",
