   "textLength": 268,
   "text": "Eventually they lost patience.\n“It was the White House’s own routine and kind of repeated declarations that this was short-lived that actually prevented this risk tolerance behaviour from emerging,” he said. “Now I think that no one believes the White House any more.”",
